      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Use WASD keys to move, left-click to interact with items, click E to release
    items. \r\n\r\nInteract with the trap door, fridge system, and the binder.\r\n\r\nGameplay
    involves fulfilling the doctor\u2019s requests (bringing him tools and body parts)
    and chopping body parts for the black market and the doctor. The trap door opens
    the black market screen and takes body parts for the black market task. Make
    sure the body parts don\u2019t decay too quickly! Use the fridge to slow down
    the decaying process and count them to the black market task.\r\n\r\nEvery second
    counts, time is ticking!\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
